WEBVTT

00:11.130 --> 00:15.460
<b>Our town is protected by a team of magical girls.</b>

00:25.380 --> 00:26.080
<b>Let's do this!</b>

00:28.920 --> 00:30.960
<b>Magenta Spear!</b>

00:38.080 --> 00:39.330
<b>Azure Sword!</b>

00:48.790 --> 00:50.420
<b>Sulfur Shield!</b>

00:58.170 --> 00:59.500
<b>Thanks, Sulfur!</b>

00:59.880 --> 01:00.830
<b>Don't mention it.</b>

01:00.830 --> 01:01.630
<b>Let's hit 'em again!</b>

01:01.790 --> 01:02.130
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:20.080 --> 01:21.250
<b>He just won't quit.</b>

01:21.460 --> 01:22.790
<b>Damn fiesty, this one.</b>

01:23.130 --> 01:24.080
<b>We've got this!</b>

01:25.250 --> 01:28.290
<b>With our powers combined,
we can take him down-together!</b>

01:28.880 --> 01:29.500
<b>Let's go!</b>

01:40.670 --> 01:42.630
<b>They're our town's magical girls.</b>

01:43.750 --> 01:46.500
<b>They fight for love and justice...</b>

01:47.130 --> 01:49.000
<b>...and battle the evil organization Enormita.</b>

01:49.880 --> 01:51.330
<b>The Tres Magia!</b>

01:55.040 --> 01:58.170
<b>They're so cute, and cool,
and have such awesome transformation scenes...</b>

01:59.130 --> 02:02.880
<b>I love them so much. I wish I could be like them...</b>

02:04.460 --> 02:07.290
<b>You can if you want, y'know.</b>

02:08.210 --> 02:08.830
<b>Huh?</b>

02:15.170 --> 02:20.420
<b>It's the cute mascot character who gives
a totally average girl the power to transform!</b>

02:20.460 --> 02:24.170
<b>Um, wow, this is all happening so fast...</b>

02:24.170 --> 02:26.830
<b>My name's Venalita. Nice to meetcha.</b>

02:27.920 --> 02:32.500
<b>Utena Hiiragi. You are the chosen one.</b>

02:43.040 --> 02:44.000
<b>Oh my God...</b>

02:45.750 --> 02:46.750
<b>I get...</b>

02:49.580 --> 02:50.960
<b>...to transform...</b>

02:54.500 --> 02:56.210
<b>...into a magical girl?!</b>

03:00.000 --> 03:00.790
<b>Oh my God...</b>

03:03.830 --> 03:05.750
<b>Oh my God!</b>

03:10.880 --> 03:11.460
<b>Huh?</b>

03:17.670 --> 03:20.380
<b>Hey, uh, is this my costume?</b>

03:20.380 --> 03:22.750
<b>Yep. Looks pretty good on you, too.</b>

03:23.130 --> 03:29.040
<b>Okay, but like, I hate to say it,
but it doesn't really scream "magical girl"...</b>

03:29.330 --> 03:31.790
<b>Well, duh. Of course it doesn't.</b>

03:31.790 --> 03:32.380
<b>Huh?</b>

03:32.750 --> 03:39.170
<b>You've been chosen to become
one of the villains in our evil organization.</b>

03:41.290 --> 03:41.880
<b>Huh?</b>

03:42.750 --> 03:49.630
<b>Oh, um, okay. Then, uh, no thanks.</b>

03:50.000 --> 03:52.580
<b>Giving up already? That's too bad.</b>

03:53.170 --> 03:55.290
<b>I'm just... gonna go now.</b>

05:31.790 --> 05:35.250
<b>A Villain is Born?!</b>

05:38.500 --> 05:39.790
<b>Utena Hiiragi.</b>

05:40.210 --> 05:42.500
<b>She's an incredibly average girl.</b>

05:43.000 --> 05:48.880
<b>She got stuck on the Beautification Committee,
so now she has to water the flowers every morning.</b>

05:49.380 --> 05:52.170
<b>She seems to like it, though.</b>

05:52.880 --> 05:55.170
<b>Why are you still here?</b>

05:55.920 --> 05:58.500
<b>I told you yesterday, I don't wanna join you.</b>

05:58.790 --> 06:01.830
<b>The mascot character always follows their girl around!</b>

06:02.000 --> 06:07.250
<b>I mean, sure, but I dunno
if that applies to evil mascots, too.</b>

06:07.540 --> 06:10.290
<b>You're applying way too much logic to this.</b>

06:10.750 --> 06:15.500
<b>Why do you care about all that Committee stuff, anyway?</b>

06:15.710 --> 06:21.580
<b>Because we're teammates! I did a bunch
of research on your family and friends, too.</b>

06:22.790 --> 06:26.040
<b>Y-you're stalking me?! I'm calling the police!</b>

06:26.170 --> 06:28.210
<b>You really think they're gonna do anything?</b>

06:30.710 --> 06:34.460
<b>Man, though, you are super, duper average.</b>

06:35.750 --> 06:37.290
<b>You've got average grades.</b>

06:38.540 --> 06:40.880
<b>You spend your time in class doodling.</b>

06:43.500 --> 06:45.040
<b>You're average at sports.</b>

06:45.790 --> 06:48.540
<b>Most people in your class forget you're even there.</b>

06:49.670 --> 06:55.670
<b>But you're totally crazy
about anything to do with magical girls.</b>

06:57.790 --> 07:05.830
<b>Your favorite time of the month is when you get your
allowance, so you can blow it all on magical girl merch.</b>

07:07.210 --> 07:11.420
<b>See? You're the perfect candidate for our next evil villain.</b>

07:12.040 --> 07:15.830
<b>None of that really explains why I am, though...</b>

07:16.170 --> 07:20.500
<b>Every person has their own unique skills,
and we can't let yours go to waste!</b>

07:20.880 --> 07:22.960
<b>But I don't want to do any of this.</b>

07:23.710 --> 07:29.880
<b>The greatest joy a human can feel
is knowing that someone, anyone, needs them.</b>

07:31.000 --> 07:35.000
<b>But I don't want to feel needed by an evil organization.</b>

07:35.080 --> 07:38.750
<b>I bet the Tres Magia need you to do this, too.</b>

07:39.080 --> 07:40.630
<b>Really?</b>

07:41.790 --> 07:43.420
<b>That can't be true.</b>

07:43.830 --> 07:47.830
<b>Magical girls only exist because
they have an evil organization to battle!</b>

07:47.830 --> 07:53.330
<b>Don't you get it? Without you,
they've got no reason to fight at all!</b>

07:55.000 --> 08:03.130
<b>And sometimes they forge stronger bonds
with the enemies they're always fighting!</b>

08:03.580 --> 08:06.750
<b>So you want me to fight the Tres Magia?</b>

08:07.040 --> 08:08.790
<b>Did I pique your interest?</b>

08:08.790 --> 08:10.040
<b>N-no!</b>

08:10.170 --> 08:12.170
<b>Okay, then, time to transform!</b>

08:12.290 --> 08:15.000
<b>Wait, but I just said-</b>

08:17.380 --> 08:19.420
<b>See what I mean? You're perfect.</b>

08:25.170 --> 08:26.420
<b>I hate you.</b>

08:27.330 --> 08:29.540
<b>If you're gonna keep complaining...</b>

08:30.040 --> 08:32.460
<b>I saw a sexy villain do her transformation.
Please share and RT.</b>

08:30.040 --> 08:39.540
<b>Venalita</b>

08:30.040 --> 08:39.540
<b>I saw a sexy villain do her transformation.</b>

08:30.040 --> 08:39.540
<b>Please share and RT.</b>

08:32.460 --> 08:37.420
<b>Then I guess your transformation animation
is going up on Snitter for our 200K followers.</b>

08:37.630 --> 08:39.540
<b>No! Don't! Please!</b>

08:39.750 --> 08:42.080
<b>That is so messed up!</b>

08:42.080 --> 08:44.000
<b>Duh, we're the bad guys.</b>

08:44.130 --> 08:45.960
<b>You gonna help us or what?</b>

08:46.080 --> 08:47.750
<b>Do I have to?!</b>

08:47.830 --> 08:51.710
<b>Hold it right there, Enormita villains!</b>

08:53.290 --> 08:56.630
<b>I knew I sensed evil around here!</b>

08:57.630 --> 09:02.420
<b>Whatever you're scheming, it ends now,
because the Tres Magia are here to stop you!</b>

09:03.960 --> 09:05.830
<b>Talk about bad timing.</b>

09:07.000 --> 09:11.960
<b>H-hey, I need help! They forced me to transform into this!</b>

09:11.960 --> 09:13.130
<b>Wait, really?!</b>

09:13.460 --> 09:16.250
<b>Oh, please, you're gonna fall for that?</b>

09:16.460 --> 09:17.710
<b>It has to be a trick!</b>

09:18.040 --> 09:20.880
<b>They... They don't believe me!</b>

09:21.000 --> 09:22.670
<b>Wow, sucks to be you.</b>

09:23.380 --> 09:24.460
<b>Say your prayers!</b>

09:24.960 --> 09:26.920
<b>Wh-wh-wh-what do I do?!</b>

09:26.920 --> 09:28.540
<b>Use your crop.</b>

09:28.540 --> 09:29.170
<b>Huh?</b>

09:29.380 --> 09:32.630
<b>This is your special weapon, the Frustino Dominanza.</b>

09:32.750 --> 09:35.290
<b>S-so what do I do with it?!</b>

09:35.790 --> 09:37.880
<b>Hit one of those flowers with it.</b>

09:38.330 --> 09:40.630
<b>Hurry up, unless you wanna get hurt.</b>

09:44.880 --> 09:46.880
<b>FLOWER!</b>

09:49.630 --> 09:51.380
<b>What the heck?</b>

09:51.790 --> 09:54.330
<b>Good. This one turned out great.</b>

09:54.630 --> 09:57.580
<b>That crop can create monsters for you to control.</b>

09:57.880 --> 09:59.000
<b>With them...</b>

10:06.960 --> 10:09.080
<b>...you just gotta say the word...</b>

10:12.380 --> 10:13.290
<b>Dammit!</b>

10:13.290 --> 10:15.750
<b>...and it'll torment the magical girls for you.</b>

10:18.750 --> 10:20.000
<b>Yes, I got 'em!</b>

10:20.460 --> 10:22.670
<b>W-wait a sec...</b>

10:23.580 --> 10:29.710
<b>Why am I happy? I'm hurting the magical girls I love...</b>

10:30.750 --> 10:34.380
<b>Something's wrong with me.</b>

10:35.080 --> 10:38.000
<b>I feel really funny...!</b>

10:39.040 --> 10:40.040
<b>Utena?</b>

10:41.170 --> 10:44.460
<b>This is good enough, right?! Can I stop now?!</b>

10:44.540 --> 10:46.170
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

10:46.750 --> 10:49.630
<b>It's time for you to get in there yourself, don'tcha think?</b>

10:50.080 --> 10:51.210
<b>Huh?</b>

10:51.420 --> 10:56.330
<b>Um, sorry, I don't... think I can do that...</b>

11:00.210 --> 11:01.580
<b>I can't move a muscle!</b>

11:02.830 --> 11:04.830
<b>Whoa, time out!</b>

11:06.830 --> 11:08.290
<b>It's too tight...</b>

11:12.000 --> 11:14.170
<b>Let go of us, you...</b>

11:18.290 --> 11:20.040
<b>Hey, uh...</b>

11:21.210 --> 11:25.420
<b>Wh-why are you doing this to us?! Please, let us go!</b>

11:25.880 --> 11:29.250
<b>Ask them for help again and this goes viral.</b>

11:31.250 --> 11:32.290
<b>So, uh...</b>

11:33.080 --> 11:37.670
<b>Could... you stick out your butts?</b>

11:37.880 --> 11:38.460
<b>Huh?</b>

11:38.460 --> 11:38.920
<b>What?</b>

11:38.920 --> 11:39.330
<b>Eh?</b>

11:41.170 --> 11:41.960
<b>No!</b>

11:42.210 --> 11:43.000
<b>What're you plotting?!</b>

11:50.250 --> 11:52.000
<b>OW!</b>

11:52.920 --> 11:54.330
<b>What is wrong with you?!</b>

11:56.210 --> 11:57.670
<b>St-stop it!</b>

11:59.130 --> 12:01.000
<b>Let me go, dammit!</b>

12:03.210 --> 12:07.210
<b>Oh, God. I'm hurting the magical girls
with my own two hands.</b>

12:07.210 --> 12:07.920
<b>Let go!</b>

12:10.080 --> 12:12.670
<b>How did this even happen?</b>

12:12.880 --> 12:15.580
<b>Is this real, or just a bad dream?</b>

12:18.330 --> 12:22.380
<b>Yeah, that's it. This must be a dream.</b>

12:24.210 --> 12:26.040
<b>And if this is just a dream...</b>

12:27.500 --> 12:30.000
<b>I might as well enjoy myself!</b>

12:30.670 --> 12:34.830
<b>My instinct never fails me, Utena Hiiragi.</b>

12:35.540 --> 12:40.330
<b>You think you love magical girls,
but what you feel isn't love at all.</b>

12:41.210 --> 12:46.080
<b>It's a twisted delight from watching them suffer.</b>

12:48.580 --> 12:54.710
<b>Utena Hiiragi, underneath it all, you are a real sadist.</b>

13:04.040 --> 13:05.130
<b>I'm awake?</b>

13:07.500 --> 13:11.830
<b>Thank goodness. What a crazy dream...</b>

13:12.670 --> 13:16.080
<b>I did kinda enjoy it, though...</b>

13:16.250 --> 13:20.170
<b>Morning, Utena. Sleep well, I take it?</b>

13:22.630 --> 13:24.790
<b>Too bad about yesterday.</b>

13:24.790 --> 13:28.500
<b>Never would've guessed the magical girls
would turn that around so fast.</b>

13:28.880 --> 13:32.830
<b>THE POWER OF FRIENDSHIP!</b>

13:29.500 --> 13:31.170
<b>THE POWER OF FRIENDSHIP!</b>

13:31.170 --> 13:32.830
<b>FLOWER!</b>

13:32.960 --> 13:37.210
<b>Meh, don't worry about it.
For your first battle, that was pretty dang good.</b>

13:37.790 --> 13:41.880
<b>But get up and at 'em! The world won't dominate itself!</b>

13:44.580 --> 13:48.960
<b>Come save me, magical girls!</b>

13:52.790 --> 13:55.500
<b>Yesterday was a disaster...</b>

13:55.790 --> 14:01.000
<b>Why is this happening to me? I love magical girls.</b>

14:06.710 --> 14:08.130
<b>Morning, Utena-chan!</b>

14:11.920 --> 14:14.080
<b>Haruka Hanabishi-chan?</b>

14:14.500 --> 14:17.250
<b>Sorry! Did I scare you?</b>

14:17.580 --> 14:20.960
<b>Wait, you... know my name?</b>

14:21.210 --> 14:23.420
<b>Well, yeah, you're in my class!</b>

14:24.880 --> 14:30.080
<b>I always see you here early taking care of the flowers!</b>

14:30.080 --> 14:31.500
<b>Y-yeah.</b>

14:31.790 --> 14:35.460
<b>Thank you! I'm sure the flowers
would thank you if they could!</b>

14:36.000 --> 14:38.000
<b>Oh, no, I...</b>

14:38.630 --> 14:40.670
<b>FLOWER!</b>

14:41.420 --> 14:43.580
<b>I don't deserve their gratitude.</b>

14:44.000 --> 14:45.710
<b>What's wrong?!</b>

14:48.830 --> 14:50.290
<b>Haruka-chan?</b>

14:50.460 --> 14:53.500
<b>I'm fine. Don't worry about it.</b>

14:53.830 --> 14:56.920
<b>I'm, uh, gonna go to class!</b>

14:56.920 --> 15:00.000
<b>Okay. I'll be there soon.</b>

15:00.000 --> 15:02.670
<b>Cool! S-see you there!</b>

15:03.380 --> 15:06.710
<b>I'll go water the flowers in the park later... As an apology.</b>

15:21.290 --> 15:24.710
<b>Nice going, Sayo! You were killing it out there today!</b>

15:27.750 --> 15:28.630
<b>You okay?</b>

15:28.630 --> 15:31.290
<b>Y-yes, I'm all right...</b>

15:32.630 --> 15:34.460
<b>Take it easy, okay?</b>

15:35.080 --> 15:37.250
<b>Are you okay, Sayo-chan?</b>

15:38.750 --> 15:40.960
<b>I feel your pain, literally.</b>

15:41.130 --> 15:42.670
<b>That wretch!</b>

15:42.670 --> 15:44.920
<b>What was with that girl?</b>

15:45.130 --> 15:47.880
<b>And what the hell was she wearing?</b>

15:48.670 --> 15:51.670
<b>She looks like she's our age.</b>

15:52.290 --> 15:54.670
<b>Wonder if we could figure out who she is...</b>

15:54.670 --> 15:56.000
<b>Probably not.</b>

15:56.130 --> 16:03.080
<b>Bet she's protected by the same magic,
so we can't recognize her when she's transformed.</b>

16:03.460 --> 16:05.500
<b>Yeah, probably...</b>

16:06.040 --> 16:08.670
<b>Whoever she is, next time, she's going down.</b>

16:08.750 --> 16:09.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:22.380 --> 16:25.630
<b>So here, you want to use this formula...</b>

16:26.790 --> 16:28.750
<b>Feel that, Sayo-chan?</b>

16:29.330 --> 16:32.250
<b>Definitely a monster. Let's go, Kaoruko.</b>

16:32.710 --> 16:35.880
<b>Sheesh. Couldn't it wait for class to be over?</b>

16:36.630 --> 16:38.960
<b>Excuse me, can I go to the bathroom?!</b>

16:39.710 --> 16:40.790
<b>All of you, right now?!</b>

16:41.080 --> 16:43.330
<b>Sorry, my bladder's about to explode!</b>

16:49.920 --> 16:51.040
<b>Trans Magia!</b>

17:28.750 --> 17:31.290
<b>My ass hurts so bad...</b>

17:31.290 --> 17:33.420
<b>I'm gonna make her pay.</b>

17:33.420 --> 17:36.420
<b>O-okay, girls, let's get 'em!</b>

17:38.580 --> 17:42.920
<b>What the-?! But I only have my family added on LIME...</b>

17:43.250 --> 17:45.170
<b>Magical girls are on the move.</b>

17:43.420 --> 17:55.670
<b>Venalita</b>

17:43.420 --> 17:49.330
<b>Magical girls are on the move.</b>

17:45.330 --> 17:46.790
<b>Get over here.</b>

17:45.380 --> 17:49.330
<b>Get over here.</b>

17:46.790 --> 17:49.080
<b>Transform and you can fly.</b>

17:46.790 --> 17:49.330
<b>Transform and you can fly.</b>

17:49.330 --> 17:53.080
<b>Get over here.</b>

17:49.330 --> 17:53.080
<b>Transform and you can fly.</b>

17:49.340 --> 17:52.710
<b>Use the thing I gave you and say "Trans Magia."</b>

17:49.340 --> 17:53.080
<b>Use the thing I gave you and say "Trans Magia."</b>

17:53.080 --> 17:54.420
<b>Transform and you can fly.</b>

17:53.080 --> 17:54.420
<b>Use the thing I gave you and say "Trans Magia."</b>

17:53.090 --> 17:54.380
<b>Meet me here.</b>

17:53.090 --> 17:54.420
<b>Meet me here.</b>

17:54.580 --> 17:55.670
<b>Meet me here.</b>

18:03.000 --> 18:05.210
<b>T-trans Magia.</b>

18:12.290 --> 18:14.080
<b>Nope, still embarrassed.</b>

18:23.040 --> 18:24.040
<b>That was a weak one.</b>

18:25.540 --> 18:29.790
<b>Hot damn, this place is creepy.
What is it, some sorta abandoned factory?</b>

18:31.540 --> 18:32.830
<b>Venalita-san...</b>

18:33.790 --> 18:35.670
<b>Sorry I'm late.</b>

18:36.080 --> 18:38.500
<b>Hey, Utena. Took you long enough.</b>

18:39.130 --> 18:41.420
<b>Okay, get out there and fight.</b>

18:41.920 --> 18:43.330
<b>Hey, uh...</b>

18:43.630 --> 18:50.710
<b>I don't think it's right to fight them,
and I kinda don't want to...</b>

18:51.040 --> 18:52.130
<b>Is that right?</b>

18:52.210 --> 18:55.460
<b>VENALITA</b>

18:52.290 --> 18:55.290
<b>I got a video of your fight from yesterday.</b>

18:55.540 --> 18:58.250
<b>Wonder what your family would think of it.</b>

18:58.670 --> 19:00.920
<b>I'd rather die!</b>

19:01.420 --> 19:06.130
<b>Cool, then go whack that mannequin
with your crop to make a monster.</b>

19:08.460 --> 19:12.630
<b>No more monsters around. Might as well head home.</b>

19:14.830 --> 19:16.580
<b>Wait, I sense something!</b>

19:21.670 --> 19:25.040
<b>H-hello, magical girls...</b>

19:25.250 --> 19:27.040
<b>You again!</b>

19:27.250 --> 19:28.710
<b>Th-this won't...</b>

19:30.750 --> 19:32.290
<b>Wh-what're you...?</b>

19:39.580 --> 19:42.040
<b>No, what's...?!</b>

19:43.460 --> 19:45.580
<b>H-holy crap, you gotta stop!</b>

19:47.830 --> 19:50.540
<b>Oh God, please not my feet!</b>

19:54.580 --> 19:55.540
<b>Not there!</b>

19:59.420 --> 20:03.210
<b>I-I'm doing it again... I'm making the Tres Magia suffer.</b>

20:03.750 --> 20:07.580
<b>I know I shouldn't. I know I should stop.</b>

20:07.880 --> 20:11.710
<b>Utena, c'mon, now. Is watching really enough?</b>

20:18.580 --> 20:20.210
<b>Why are you doing this?</b>

20:22.460 --> 20:23.080
<b>Hey.</b>

20:31.830 --> 20:33.580
<b>Is it too much?</b>

20:34.540 --> 20:36.330
<b>Do your sides hurt?</b>

20:37.500 --> 20:40.040
<b>Do you want it to stop?</b>

20:41.420 --> 20:45.040
<b>P-please, stop! I can't take it anymore!</b>

20:45.750 --> 20:47.130
<b>How about you?</b>

20:49.130 --> 20:53.000
<b>Or you? Your feet are particularly sensitive, right?</b>

20:53.000 --> 20:54.540
<b>Please, no!</b>

20:56.750 --> 21:01.790
<b>I'm making them squirm... with my own two hands.</b>

21:03.790 --> 21:05.000
<b>More...</b>

21:06.170 --> 21:07.830
<b>I need more...</b>

21:10.170 --> 21:12.130
<b>...of those cute little faces!</b>

21:15.460 --> 21:15.960
<b>That's it...!</b>

21:18.540 --> 21:20.500
<b>She still lacks power.</b>

21:21.330 --> 21:23.750
<b>Time to go. Let's fall back.</b>

21:24.420 --> 21:25.540
<b>Okay.</b>

21:29.580 --> 21:30.710
<b>Get back here!</b>

21:46.960 --> 21:49.170
<b>I can't believe I did it again...</b>

21:59.540 --> 22:01.880
<b>Damn, you were really enjoying yourself.</b>

22:02.540 --> 22:05.500
<b>Wh-what makes you think I was enjoying myself?!</b>

23:36.130 --> 23:41.000
<b>Her Name is Magia Baiser!</b>
